[One particular page's corner in this curative tome is more dog-eared than the rest.]\n</p><p><br>\n<b>ARCANE PARALYSIS</b>\n</p><p><br>\nCOMMON SOURCES\n</p><p>- Suckling on fizztree blossom\n</p><p>- Deep monastic meditation\n</p><p>- Curious <a href=\"/wiki/Meenlock\" title=\"Meenlock\">meenlocks</a>\n</p><p>- Misc. poisons (<a href=\"/wiki/Karabasan%27s_Gift\" title=\"Karabasan's Gift\">Karabasan's Gift</a>, chuul extract, etc.)\n</p><p>- Incurious meenlocks\n</p><p><br>\nCURATIVE SOLUTIONS\n</p><p>- Healing abjurations (<a href=\"/wiki/Lesser_Restoration\" title=\"Lesser Restoration\">Lesser Restoration</a>, etc.)\n</p><p>- Restorative elixers (general antidotes, remedial potions, etc.)\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1391/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25185/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6406/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931494/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.041      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.041      1 -total\n 51.68%   23.794      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.85%   20.649     15 Template:Trim\n 22.33%   10.279      2 Template:Uid\n 14.35%    6.607      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.62%    5.808      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.15%    5.132      6 Template:Ifempty\n 11.07%    5.098      1 Template:Books\n 10.48%    4.826      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31090-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202230 and revision id 364913. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}